@startuml use-case-admin
left to right direction
skinparam actorStyle awesome
actor "Security Admin" as Admin
rectangle "Security administration" {
  usecase "UC-13\nQuản lý account / role" as accounts
  usecase "UC-14\nVersion AuthPolicy" as policy
  usecase "UC-15\nVersion RuleSet" as rules
  usecase "UC-16\nCấu hình notification channel" as channels
  usecase "UC-17\nTrust / block list có expiry" as lists
  usecase "UC-18\nXem audit event" as audit
  usecase "UC-19\nTham số vận hành" as operations
}
Admin --> accounts
Admin --> policy
Admin --> rules
Admin --> channels
Admin --> lists
Admin --> audit
Admin --> operations
note right of policy
Policy/rule changes are immutable, versioned, reviewable and reversible.
end note
@enduml
